==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|fljótr}}, synchronically analyzed as {{af|is|fljóta|-ur|t1=to float}}, thus "swift like many floating objects".

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈfljouː.tʏr/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ouːtʏr|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|@@}}

# [[swift]], [[quick]], [[fast]]
#: {{uxi|is|Þú skalt vera '''fljótur''' eða ég nái þér.|You better be '''quick''' or I'll catch up to you.}}

